+## 2026-09-22 · R1 Wave 5: pipeline and content quality
+
+Source: `docs/remediation-r1/05_R1_W5_Pipeline_and_Content.md`; record `PROGRESS.md` ("Wave 5 deviations and carry-overs"). Commit `5b4764e feat(r1-w5): title cleaning, series keys, enrich rules, price notes, alt text, digest from live data, guide copy` (the spec's subject said "image waterfall"; that task carried over). Decisions D4, D6, D9, D12, D13.
+
+Titles: `ingest/clean.ts` splits "Title | Venue", expands acronyms from `ingest/data/acronyms.json` (LOTG becomes "Library on the Go"), calms shouting titles and lifts addresses out of blurbs. 563 rows changed; zero published titles now contain a pipe or "LOTG"; 532 rows gained a `venue_name`. Series: `ingest/series.ts` writes `series_key` for every dated row (1,928 rows, 940 series, 198 with more than one date). The key is title plus venue, without the weekday the prose asked for, because the weekday split the Arts and Crafts Show and gave Recreation Swim 18 keys. A cadence sentence is derived from the dates. Blurbs: `ingest/blurbRules.ts` states the blurb rules as tests, and the enrich prompt carries them. A blurb that repeats the title, names the wrong weekday, holds an address or uses a banned phrase is rejected at landing; length alone is not a defect. Display: cards read `blurb` and detail reads `blurb_long ?? blurb`. One `priceLabel()` puts `price_note` first, with a "$ under 15" key. Outbound buttons name the destination, and photos carry title-plus-venue alt. Digest: /digest/sample renders the coming send window from live data (D12). Guides: one Funk Zone block count, a walk line per guide, stale "Right now" hidden after 45 days, and the deliberate-error line retired (D13). Dashes: D9 is enforced in source. 27 files were corrected, and `scripts/check-emdash.mjs` fails on U+2013 too. Carried over: the AI re-enrichment batch run and the W5.7 image waterfall change.
