+Retirement: `ingest/retire.ts` runs nightly from `ingest/run.ts` and archives an event 7 days after it ends (`retire:dryrun` / `retire:apply`). 1,017 rows were archived at CP1, then 4 more, taking published from 1,529 to 508. Archived pages: detail pages stay reachable with "already happened on [date]", noindex and a working heart. Out-of-month dates print the year, and the Verified stamp needs a confirmation within 90 days. The shared-list page resolves ids directly. Civic: `ingest/civic.ts` flags civic meetings and closure notices at land time (rules as data; 136 rows backfilled), and the pool, search and Plan exclude them. The city calendar is title-tested rather than blanket-flagged, which kept 23 of its 40 real activities. Pick: CP2 applied `hero_eligible` (49 of 512 rows lost it). The pick now requires eligibility, a real address and a start no more than 30 minutes past. The bare fallback is gone, and the pick is computed before the filters. Eyebrow: "Gray day move" needs genuinely gray weather and an indoor pick. Nearby list: dedupes by title, drops civic and finished rows, and caps at 5. Cockpit: the Live catalog gained Archived and Civic filters. Blocked: pushing the branch (iCloud evicted git objects).
